(6643720, 992365, 86447, '<td valign="top">I''d like this very much for a challenge where the people or the shadows from the people  (not the architecture) were important to the challenge topic.   As it is, the people and their shadows are making this magnificent.   But... I''d hoped for some architecture to add to it, since that''s the topic.   <br/> <br/>(not voting, just commenting)</td>', 'I''d like this very much for a challenge where the people or the shadows from the people  (not the architecture) were important to the challenge topic.   As it is, the people and their shadows are making this magnificent.   But... I''d hoped for some architecture to add to it, since that''s the topic.    (not voting, just commenting)', '2012-01-13 00:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
