(6643725, 992356, 86447, '<td valign="top">Yeah... the people add... but this is ALL ABOUT THE ARCHITECTURE!   Well done!<br/> <br/>I feel this.</td>', 'Yeah... the people add... but this is ALL ABOUT THE ARCHITECTURE!   Well done! I feel this.', '2012-01-13 00:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
