(6643752, 992038, 96751, '<td valign="top">Oh, I LOVE this.  Marvelous swirl of textures and shapes, and that heavenly light reflection off unseen windows.</td>', 'Oh, I LOVE this.  Marvelous swirl of textures and shapes, and that heavenly light reflection off unseen windows.', '2012-01-13 00:23:54.000000', NULL, 1),
