(6643769, 992571, 96751, '<td valign="top">I have to believe this is Eli''s red door, behind which fumes a paranoid lady.  Apologies if this is not that image.  Love the tension here.</td>', 'I have to believe this is Eli''s red door, behind which fumes a paranoid lady.  Apologies if this is not that image.  Love the tension here.', '2012-01-13 00:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643771, 992448, 86447, '<td valign="top">Challenge description:  <i> Take a picture of a structure in a way that emphasizes emotional content rather than form. Subject should be identifiable as a structure, and although human elements can appear in the image, it should be predominantly about the building</i> <br/> <br/> <br/>Yet, I don''t see a building.  <br/> <br/>I really hope others see a building... I really like this image (but not for this topic).<br/> <br/>(not voting)</td>', 'Challenge description:   Take a picture of a structure in a way that emphasizes emotional content rather than form. Subject should be identifiable as a structure, and although human elements can appear in the image, it should be predominantly about the building   Yet, I don''t see a building.   I really hope others see a building... I really like this image (but not for this topic). (not voting)', '2012-01-13 00:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
