(6643777, 992389, 142483, '<td valign="top">Wow, what an amazing image. Love it! Not 100% sure what emotions it gives, but I definitely feel... something... I just can''t put a word to it!</td>', 'Wow, what an amazing image. Love it! Not 100% sure what emotions it gives, but I definitely feel... something... I just can''t put a word to it!', '2012-01-13 00:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
