(6643785, 992082, 96751, '<td valign="top">Stunning.  I believe I''ve seen this before, and I had the same comment then as I have now - the tones are too even and too similar, without leading the eye in any particular direction.  The chandeliers and the aisle help in that regard, but tonally, this could be far more interesting.  I imagine that despite my protestations, this will finish near or at the top.</td>', 'Stunning.  I believe I''ve seen this before, and I had the same comment then as I have now - the tones are too even and too similar, without leading the eye in any particular direction.  The chandeliers and the aisle help in that regard, but tonally, this could be far more interesting.  I imagine that despite my protestations, this will finish near or at the top.', '2012-01-13 00:29:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643786, 992420, 96751, '<td valign="top">As if it were about to float away</td>', 'As if it were about to float away', '2012-01-13 00:29:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643787, 992147, 86447, '<td valign="top">Golly!   This is a tough one.<br/><i> <br/>"Take a picture of a structure in a way that emphasizes emotional content rather than form. Subject should be identifiable as a structure, and although human elements can appear in the image, it should be predominantly about the building"</i> <br/> <br/>Oddly enough, the most brilliant part for me, the biker and bike are what makes this image lesser for the challenge topic for me.<br/> <br/>For the topic, I think this image would have scored much better without the part your worked the hardest for.<br/> <br/>*sigh*<br/> <br/>But, I''m only commenting, not voting.   So... that''s good, huh?  *smile*</td>', 'Golly!   This is a tough one. "Take a picture of a structure in a way that emphasizes emotional content rather than form. Subject should be identifiable as a structure, and although human elements can appear in the image, it should be predominantly about the building"  Oddly enough, the most brilliant part for me, the biker and bike are what makes this image lesser for the challenge topic for me. For the topic, I think this image would have scored much better without the part your worked the hardest for. *sigh* But, I''m only commenting, not voting.   So... that''s good, huh?  *smile*', '2012-01-13 00:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643791, 992578, 96751, '<td valign="top">The aspect ratio does not work for me.  Although it does give a sense of constriction, the extremely narrow crop is a detriment for me.</td>', 'The aspect ratio does not work for me.  Although it does give a sense of constriction, the extremely narrow crop is a detriment for me.', '2012-01-13 00:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643792, 992360, 86447, '<td valign="top">Oh golly!    GREAT play on words to go with your wonderful image!<br/> <br/>(only commenting, not voting)<br/> <br/>I hope this does well for you!</td>', 'Oh golly!    GREAT play on words to go with your wonderful image! (only commenting, not voting) I hope this does well for you!', '2012-01-13 00:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643793, 992448, 142483, '<td valign="top">I think people will dock your score by claiming this is not a building... but the challenge (in my mind) is open to interpretation, by the repeated use of the word "structure". I think this is an accepatable interpretation of a structure, and I like that it does emphasize some emotions. Butterflies generally have a happy feel, but this makes me feel sad and sympathetic, because of their isolation. Well done</td>', 'I think people will dock your score by claiming this is not a building... but the challenge (in my mind) is open to interpretation, by the repeated use of the word "structure". I think this is an accepatable interpretation of a structure, and I like that it does emphasize some emotions. Butterflies generally have a happy feel, but this makes me feel sad and sympathetic, because of their isolation. Well done', '2012-01-13 00:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643795, 992195, 86447, '<td valign="top">Brilliant.<br/> <br/>LOVE the face.  You''ve nailed this challenge topic!<br/> <br/> <br/>(only commenting, not voting)</td>', 'Brilliant. LOVE the face.  You''ve nailed this challenge topic!  (only commenting, not voting)', '2012-01-13 00:32:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643796, 991704, 142483, '<td valign="top">I like that this gives off a tough, scary feel. The emotion that I sense is almost a lack-of-emotion, toughened and hard and non-feeling. If that makes ANY sense whatsoever haha. I like it :)</td>', 'I like that this gives off a tough, scary feel. The emotion that I sense is almost a lack-of-emotion, toughened and hard and non-feeling. If that makes ANY sense whatsoever haha. I like it :)', '2012-01-13 00:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643797, 991633, 142483, '<td valign="top">Gloomy and kind of sad, fits the challenge, well done</td>', 'Gloomy and kind of sad, fits the challenge, well done', '2012-01-13 00:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643800, 992470, 116649, '<td valign="top">Very interesting and eye catching capture.  May I ask, what emotion does it evoke in you?</td>', 'Very interesting and eye catching capture.  May I ask, what emotion does it evoke in you?', '2012-01-13 00:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643803, 992590, 142483, '<td valign="top">I don''t really get any emotion from this image. It''s setting (a prison cell block) should give off a somber and dark feel, but the colours and processing negate those feelings... so I''m kind of left with nothing.</td>', 'I don''t really get any emotion from this image. It''s setting (a prison cell block) should give off a somber and dark feel, but the colours and processing negate those feelings... so I''m kind of left with nothing.', '2012-01-13 00:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643804, 992581, 116649, '<td valign="top">Ahhh...   Must be a real estate agent!  :)  Nice shot.</td>', 'Ahhh...   Must be a real estate agent!  :)  Nice shot.', '2012-01-13 00:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643805, 992578, 142483, '<td valign="top">Scary and a little suspensful, I like it</td>', 'Scary and a little suspensful, I like it', '2012-01-13 00:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643806, 992449, 142483, '<td valign="top">I''m not 100% sold on the actual image itself, but it certainly has an uplifting feel, which is what the challenge requests. Well done</td>', 'I''m not 100% sold on the actual image itself, but it certainly has an uplifting feel, which is what the challenge requests. Well done', '2012-01-13 00:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643807, 991965, 96751, '<td valign="top">Delicate details</td>', 'Delicate details', '2012-01-13 00:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643809, 992470, 142483, '<td valign="top">Woah... it almost hurts my eyes to look at this haha. But I definitely like it. It feels very monotonous and dull, which is actually a good thing with this challenge. Nice work</td>', 'Woah... it almost hurts my eyes to look at this haha. But I definitely like it. It feels very monotonous and dull, which is actually a good thing with this challenge. Nice work', '2012-01-13 00:38:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643811, 992586, 142483, '<td valign="top">Is it raining in this shot? Or is that just the grain? It''s kind of depressing, while still being beautiful, which may not have been what you were going for, but that''s what I get from it. Good shot</td>', 'Is it raining in this shot? Or is that just the grain? It''s kind of depressing, while still being beautiful, which may not have been what you were going for, but that''s what I get from it. Good shot', '2012-01-13 00:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643814, 992534, 116649, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Now I am lonely and sad...  :(</td>', 'Very nice.  Now I am lonely and sad...  :(', '2012-01-13 00:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643816, 992356, 116649, '<td valign="top">Awesome!</td>', 'Awesome!', '2012-01-13 00:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643817, 992457, 142483, '<td valign="top">Wow, this takes my breath away. What a wonderful image, and full of calm and serene emotions, and just a hint of sad too. The only improvement would''ve been for the birds to be sharp and in focus, but I understand that would''ve been impossible with a long exposure for the water (unless you can train the birds to stay perfectly still? haha). Fantastic shot, I really love it, fits the challenge perfectly</td>', 'Wow, this takes my breath away. What a wonderful image, and full of calm and serene emotions, and just a hint of sad too. The only improvement would''ve been for the birds to be sharp and in focus, but I understand that would''ve been impossible with a long exposure for the water (unless you can train the birds to stay perfectly still? haha). Fantastic shot, I really love it, fits the challenge perfectly', '2012-01-13 00:41:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643818, 992069, 96751, '<td valign="top">Another Gehry structure? Gorgeous, love those angles and that light!!!</td>', 'Another Gehry structure? Gorgeous, love those angles and that light!!!', '2012-01-13 00:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643821, 992449, 96751, '<td valign="top">I think I''ve seen this room before, in a mosque?  Splendid location, but there''s a lot of fringing going on, which blurs the details a bit.</td>', 'I think I''ve seen this room before, in a mosque?  Splendid location, but there''s a lot of fringing going on, which blurs the details a bit.', '2012-01-13 00:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643822, 992570, 142483, '<td valign="top">This is a nice photograph, and nicely processed, I do like the colours and the skyline, but it doesnt evoke any emotions in me, personally. Not sure what emotions or feelings you were going for.</td>', 'This is a nice photograph, and nicely processed, I do like the colours and the skyline, but it doesnt evoke any emotions in me, personally. Not sure what emotions or feelings you were going for.', '2012-01-13 00:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643826, 991578, 96751, '<td valign="top">Oh goodness, so far, my favorite.  Incredibly organic and forlorn</td>', 'Oh goodness, so far, my favorite.  Incredibly organic and forlorn', '2012-01-13 00:43:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643828, 991685, 142483, '<td valign="top">Parking may emote fury (ok, 99% of the time it emotes fury!) but this image doesnt. If I hadn''t read the title, I wouldn''t have picked that you were going for fury.</td>', 'Parking may emote fury (ok, 99% of the time it emotes fury!) but this image doesnt. If I hadn''t read the title, I wouldn''t have picked that you were going for fury.', '2012-01-13 00:44:05.000000', NULL, 1),
