(6643835, 992195, 142483, '<td valign="top">Ha, I love the almost literal take on "emotive architecture". I''m sure this intentionally looks like an angry face. I don''t think the processing of the image helps to evoke anger or an attacking feel (the colours are so soft and inviting) but I like it. You had a good eye to spot that. Well done</td>', 'Ha, I love the almost literal take on "emotive architecture". I''m sure this intentionally looks like an angry face. I don''t think the processing of the image helps to evoke anger or an attacking feel (the colours are so soft and inviting) but I like it. You had a good eye to spot that. Well done', '2012-01-13 00:46:36.000000', NULL, 1),
