(6644075, 992587, 129512, '<td valign="top">Penny, that you?<br/> <br/>Oh the W. R. Grace Building. I actually wanted to use this building as my entry but I couldn''t get to 42nd st..<br/> <br/>Lovely B&amp;W. Very nicely done. Hope this scores well!</td>', 'Penny, that you? Oh the W. R. Grace Building. I actually wanted to use this building as my entry but I couldn''t get to 42nd st.. Lovely B&W. Very nicely done. Hope this scores well!', '2012-01-13 08:06:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6644076, 992588, 49018, '<td valign="top">I was about to give this a 5, then I thought how emotive the sight of this would be for a child. The expectation, the day out and the special occasion, and the rows of seats drifting in darkness when lights goes down. As adults we progressively loose that, what a pity. 8</td>', 'I was about to give this a 5, then I thought how emotive the sight of this would be for a child. The expectation, the day out and the special occasion, and the rows of seats drifting in darkness when lights goes down. As adults we progressively loose that, what a pity. 8', '2012-01-13 08:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6644077, 992448, 124190, '<td valign="top">This MUST be a verifiable scientific lab shot....or it''s out of The Silence of the Lambs........   10 for creativity....10 for butterfly torture......  :-((((<br/> <br/>and what the hey...the jars actually say butterfly collection.....<br/> <br/>not Ball.....hmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmm    let''s hope they are listening to Mozart and not Rap.    LET THEM GOOOOOOOOOOOOO!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!<br/>Why is this happening?   Please explain.   Emotive is an understatement.</td>', 'This MUST be a verifiable scientific lab shot....or it''s out of The Silence of the Lambs........   10 for creativity....10 for butterfly torture......  :-(((( and what the hey...the jars actually say butterfly collection..... not Ball.....hmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmm    let''s hope they are listening to Mozart and not Rap.    LET THEM GOOOOOOOOOOOOO!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!Why is this happening?   Please explain.   Emotive is an understatement.', '2012-01-13 08:16:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6644078, 992401, 124190, '<td valign="top">Fabulous.</td>', 'Fabulous.', '2012-01-13 08:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6644091, 992540, 49018, '<td valign="top">I like the tones and general feel. I am a bit uncertain about the framing and angle, like there was a torn wish to include more of the tops and more of the stairs, with the image undecided there in the middle.<br/>For sure it would work better for me with a crop exclusing completely the rail on the right, the pink wall is beautiful. actually, a tigher oblique crop including the pink wall/window and the tiles on the opposite wall would have been quite nice and enahnce the  feel of descent which perhaps you wished to depict.</td>', 'I like the tones and general feel. I am a bit uncertain about the framing and angle, like there was a torn wish to include more of the tops and more of the stairs, with the image undecided there in the middle.For sure it would work better for me with a crop exclusing completely the rail on the right, the pink wall is beautiful. actually, a tigher oblique crop including the pink wall/window and the tiles on the opposite wall would have been quite nice and enahnce the  feel of descent which perhaps you wished to depict.', '2012-01-13 08:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6644096, 992481, 49018, '<td valign="top">Nice geometry and processing. I wonder if it would work better with a crop excluding the top element.</td>', 'Nice geometry and processing. I wonder if it would work better with a crop excluding the top element.', '2012-01-13 08:38:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6644097, 992195, 49018, '<td valign="top">Suitably threatening :)</td>', 'Suitably threatening :)', '2012-01-13 08:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6644099, 992477, 113156, '<td valign="top">25p each is not bad actually, superb photo and pleasantly different from most.</td>', '25p each is not bad actually, superb photo and pleasantly different from most.', '2012-01-13 08:48:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6644104, 991603, 113156, '<td valign="top">wickedly good.</td>', 'wickedly good.', '2012-01-13 08:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6644107, 992560, 59029, '<td valign="top">almost a little too much tilt, and would like to see a slightly more decrepit house for a witch, but decent enough entry.</td>', 'almost a little too much tilt, and would like to see a slightly more decrepit house for a witch, but decent enough entry.', '2012-01-13 08:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6644110, 992453, 10785, '<td valign="top">Arrogance and despair seem to be conflicting emotions not occurring together. The photo in no way evokes a sense of desperation but the arrogance shows through the design of these Corinthian columns.</td>', 'Arrogance and despair seem to be conflicting emotions not occurring together. The photo in no way evokes a sense of desperation but the arrogance shows through the design of these Corinthian columns.', '2012-01-13 09:05:21.000000', NULL, 1),
