(6644314, 992509, 94265, '<td valign="top">I think this one fits the challenge the most. Love the perspective, perfect exposure, great crisp focus and a very interesting subject. Well done, ribbon ahead hopefully?</td>', 'I think this one fits the challenge the most. Love the perspective, perfect exposure, great crisp focus and a very interesting subject. Well done, ribbon ahead hopefully?', '2012-01-13 13:18:17.000000', NULL, 1),
