(6644439, 992199, 142473, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot!  I''m hoping this one gets front page at least!</td>', 'Excellent shot!  I''m hoping this one gets front page at least!', '2012-01-13 16:24:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6644440, 992470, 142473, '<td valign="top">Wow... what a capture!  All you need to do is just look up eh?</td>', 'Wow... what a capture!  All you need to do is just look up eh?', '2012-01-13 16:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6644509, 992422, 94265, '<td valign="top">A military graveyard, I assume; Great DOF, nice focus on the stone in front. Fits the challenge for me, not your typical definition of architecture maybe but emotive, yes.</td>', 'A military graveyard, I assume; Great DOF, nice focus on the stone in front. Fits the challenge for me, not your typical definition of architecture maybe but emotive, yes.', '2012-01-13 18:04:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6644511, 992082, 61396, '<td valign="top">Hey, MR. BAGHEAD: The only reason I am not writing you that you are going to blue is because I don''t want to jinx it.</td>', 'Hey, MR. BAGHEAD: The only reason I am not writing you that you are going to blue is because I don''t want to jinx it.', '2012-01-13 18:08:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6644512, 992571, 12611, '<td valign="top">Could this be <i>the</i> fabled red door? Nice back story.</td>', 'Could this be the fabled red door? Nice back story.', '2012-01-13 18:08:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6644513, 992513, 12611, '<td valign="top">Love the glossy color and detail here.</td>', 'Love the glossy color and detail here.', '2012-01-13 18:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6644514, 992365, 12611, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition.Like three passengers in a boat.</td>', 'Excellent composition.Like three passengers in a boat.', '2012-01-13 18:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6644584, 992571, 64446, '<td valign="top">Great mood evoking the the simple simple lines of an otherwise inviting house. That''s enhanced by the burgundy lighting all around.</td>', 'Great mood evoking the the simple simple lines of an otherwise inviting house. That''s enhanced by the burgundy lighting all around.', '2012-01-13 20:28:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6644587, 992590, 10785, '<td valign="top">I like the slight peek inside to see the skeletal bunk of an inmate from yore... Exposure is good but the scene is somewhat bright and lacks good lighting conditions for that extra emotional content.</td>', 'I like the slight peek inside to see the skeletal bunk of an inmate from yore... Exposure is good but the scene is somewhat bright and lacks good lighting conditions for that extra emotional content.', '2012-01-13 20:40:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6644592, 992360, 10785, '<td valign="top">Very emotive evoking a feeling of achievement. Especially with the title. The fact that it''s pointing up brings along a sense of hope and general positive emotion. The composition and lighting are good. I was thinking if a centered composition might help and I don''t think it would.</td>', 'Very emotive evoking a feeling of achievement. Especially with the title. The fact that it''s pointing up brings along a sense of hope and general positive emotion. The composition and lighting are good. I was thinking if a centered composition might help and I don''t think it would.', '2012-01-13 20:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6644595, 992082, 64446, '<td valign="top">Me too - overwhelmed! You conveyed it so well, Doc. Exceptional work to ribbon! Go Long Shots!!!</td>', 'Me too - overwhelmed! You conveyed it so well, Doc. Exceptional work to ribbon! Go Long Shots!!!', '2012-01-13 20:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6644600, 992195, 64446, '<td valign="top">Great eye to identify this pareidolia, and so elegantly executed. Also, the contrast of the figure the structure portraits with the nice pastel tones is a plus in this image. Excellent job, Rian! Go Long Shots!!!</td>', 'Great eye to identify this pareidolia, and so elegantly executed. Also, the contrast of the figure the structure portraits with the nice pastel tones is a plus in this image. Excellent job, Rian! Go Long Shots!!!', '2012-01-13 21:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6644602, 992069, 64446, '<td valign="top">This is simple and effective. Love how the smooth transitions and nuances of light and shade, along with the warmer tones in the back left and the  textures. Very good job, Dennis. Go Long Shots!!!</td>', 'This is simple and effective. Love how the smooth transitions and nuances of light and shade, along with the warmer tones in the back left and the  textures. Very good job, Dennis. Go Long Shots!!!', '2012-01-13 21:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6644613, 992502, 64446, '<td valign="top">This is a slick and smart image! An exquisite structure with such striking colours! The super modern with cold colours contrasting with the old and warmer colours in the reflections is outstanding. I love this image the first time I saw it. Great job, Alessandro!. Go Long Shots!!!</td>', 'This is a slick and smart image! An exquisite structure with such striking colours! The super modern with cold colours contrasting with the old and warmer colours in the reflections is outstanding. I love this image the first time I saw it. Great job, Alessandro!. Go Long Shots!!!', '2012-01-13 21:21:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6644618, 992199, 64446, '<td valign="top">Amazing composition. I love you got the human elements that bring perspective of the grandeur of this whole place. Its mesmerizing and even difficult to understand how the whole structure works. The lighting is almost magical... Excellent work, Mita. Go Long Shots!!!</td>', 'Amazing composition. I love you got the human elements that bring perspective of the grandeur of this whole place. Its mesmerizing and even difficult to understand how the whole structure works. The lighting is almost magical... Excellent work, Mita. Go Long Shots!!!', '2012-01-13 21:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6644620, 992420, 64446, '<td valign="top">Behold an enchanted image! It feels as a small breeze would torn down such a delicate structure. Probably because of the soft warm light you captured, keeping the subject off centered. I''m glad you didn''t follow my suggestion, and kept the branches in - it''s so much better this way. Great job, Tommy! Go Long Shots!!!</td>', 'Behold an enchanted image! It feels as a small breeze would torn down such a delicate structure. Probably because of the soft warm light you captured, keeping the subject off centered. I''m glad you didn''t follow my suggestion, and kept the branches in - it''s so much better this way. Great job, Tommy! Go Long Shots!!!', '2012-01-13 21:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6644646, 992479, 135629, '<td valign="top">Cool House!</td>', 'Cool House!', '2012-01-13 22:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6644648, 991917, 135629, '<td valign="top">Seen SOOOOO many variations of this same subject in so many challenges... but again, it''s a great photo! 8</td>', 'Seen SOOOOO many variations of this same subject in so many challenges... but again, it''s a great photo! 8', '2012-01-13 22:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6644650, 992533, 64086, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition. Love the sun(or moon?) on the edge. Grain in the sky compliments the texture of the building.</td>', 'Very nice composition. Love the sun(or moon?) on the edge. Grain in the sky compliments the texture of the building.', '2012-01-13 22:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6644660, 991578, 64086, '<td valign="top">The shapes are strong and simple, but I find there''s a lot of detail to look for beyond that. My eye is drawn to the mysterious deep black in the upper right and the out to the edge and back down. The tree is wonderful and the photo is very emotional and interesting.</td>', 'The shapes are strong and simple, but I find there''s a lot of detail to look for beyond that. My eye is drawn to the mysterious deep black in the upper right and the out to the edge and back down. The tree is wonderful and the photo is very emotional and interesting.', '2012-01-13 22:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6644722, 992587, 66398, '<td valign="top">This is perfect!! I love it!</td>', 'This is perfect!! I love it!', '2012-01-14 01:19:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6644727, 992364, 140777, '<td valign="top">Amazing window!</td>', 'Amazing window!', '2012-01-14 02:05:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6644736, 992477, 35321, '<td valign="top">I might have rotated it a hair counter-clockwise, but the BW processing is spot on, and the composition is masterful. Bravo. 9</td>', 'I might have rotated it a hair counter-clockwise, but the BW processing is spot on, and the composition is masterful. Bravo. 9', '2012-01-14 02:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6644743, 992195, 142929, '<td valign="top">Ha, that is well spotted, and well captioned.</td>', 'Ha, that is well spotted, and well captioned.', '2012-01-14 04:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6644744, 992470, 142929, '<td valign="top">The repetition and strong geometric lines are quite interesting. As is the monochrome. Well captured.</td>', 'The repetition and strong geometric lines are quite interesting. As is the monochrome. Well captured.', '2012-01-14 04:34:23.000000', NULL, 1),
