(6645517, 992288, 113142, '<td valign="top">The idea is wonderful (i mean, terrible!), but for some reason the image itself, though telling a STORY of shameful proportions, doesn''t really convey any FEELING to me. Spurs one to be REACtive rather than EMOtive. Call me presumptuous, but emotive imaging would would do just as well without knowing what the "object" in the image was, to convey an idea without words or any formal knowledge. Good photo, regardless. It is a terrible thing that so much effort, time and money has been wasted instead of put to good use over there. People like you are necessary to keep others aware!</td>', 'The idea is wonderful (i mean, terrible!), but for some reason the image itself, though telling a STORY of shameful proportions, doesn''t really convey any FEELING to me. Spurs one to be REACtive rather than EMOtive. Call me presumptuous, but emotive imaging would would do just as well without knowing what the "object" in the image was, to convey an idea without words or any formal knowledge. Good photo, regardless. It is a terrible thing that so much effort, time and money has been wasted instead of put to good use over there. People like you are necessary to keep others aware!', '2012-01-15 16:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6645518, 991910, 113142, '<td valign="top">This shot is stunning, but is this architecture? no authority, but methinks you straddle a line here :)</td>', 'This shot is stunning, but is this architecture? no authority, but methinks you straddle a line here :)', '2012-01-15 16:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6645519, 992470, 113142, '<td valign="top">THIS is emotive: the bland, repetitious and crushing compartmentalization of our very souls is at stake! Must have been difficult to pick JUST the right angle to shoot this at.</td>', 'THIS is emotive: the bland, repetitious and crushing compartmentalization of our very souls is at stake! Must have been difficult to pick JUST the right angle to shoot this at.', '2012-01-15 16:19:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6645522, 992590, 113142, '<td valign="top">Good detail, good subject. I feel torn, though, between the cold (tungsten WB?) of the cell interior and teh warmth of the door and wall. If all was so cold, I would have felt absolutely hopeless.</td>', 'Good detail, good subject. I feel torn, though, between the cold (tungsten WB?) of the cell interior and teh warmth of the door and wall. If all was so cold, I would have felt absolutely hopeless.', '2012-01-15 16:21:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6645530, 992422, 113142, '<td valign="top">certainly emotive, needs no words nor formal title (the one you chose was perfect!), so good job on that, but architecture it is not.</td>', 'certainly emotive, needs no words nor formal title (the one you chose was perfect!), so good job on that, but architecture it is not.', '2012-01-15 16:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
