(6648213, 992466, 64446, '<td valign="top">The stone textures and the arches evoke an indescribable feeling, which is enhanced by the B&amp;W and dark tones... Good job.</td>', 'The stone textures and the arches evoke an indescribable feeling, which is enhanced by the B&W and dark tones... Good job.', '2012-01-18 01:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6648219, 992509, 64446, '<td valign="top">This is unique! Love the contrast of the "floating" rough surreal bust against the squares and converging lines. Smart composition - congratulations!</td>', 'This is unique! Love the contrast of the "floating" rough surreal bust against the squares and converging lines. Smart composition - congratulations!', '2012-01-18 01:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6648226, 991917, 64446, '<td valign="top">Indeed - hard to sort out this structure. Love the golden tones, along with the silvers and blues...</td>', 'Indeed - hard to sort out this structure. Love the golden tones, along with the silvers and blues...', '2012-01-18 01:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6648255, 992558, 113156, '<td valign="top">Love the slither of light, exstremly well done and seen.</td>', 'Love the slither of light, exstremly well done and seen.', '2012-01-18 01:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6648351, 991476, 142815, '<td valign="top">The lighting is terrific. B&amp;W really accentuates the haunted theme.</td>', 'The lighting is terrific. B&W really accentuates the haunted theme.', '2012-01-18 05:29:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6648352, 992475, 142815, '<td valign="top">This doesnt really work for me. Not sure what the real focal point is of the photo?</td>', 'This doesnt really work for me. Not sure what the real focal point is of the photo?', '2012-01-18 05:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6648353, 992356, 142815, '<td valign="top">this is fantastic. The lines are superb and colours just add to the overall ambience. The people also add the scale element but at the same time are in the distance so as not to distrsct from the building.</td>', 'this is fantastic. The lines are superb and colours just add to the overall ambience. The people also add the scale element but at the same time are in the distance so as not to distrsct from the building.', '2012-01-18 05:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6648354, 992502, 142815, '<td valign="top">Great lines and the refletion in the windows adds a ncie element.</td>', 'Great lines and the refletion in the windows adds a ncie element.', '2012-01-18 05:34:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6648365, 992467, 113156, '<td valign="top">beautiful.</td>', 'beautiful.', '2012-01-18 05:54:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6648367, 992401, 113156, '<td valign="top">I think my current avatar was taken in Ta Prohm, nice to see it again, good shot in difficult conditions.</td>', 'I think my current avatar was taken in Ta Prohm, nice to see it again, good shot in difficult conditions.', '2012-01-18 06:05:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6648380, 992548, 113156, '<td valign="top">I find this fantastic and yes unfortunately this is the heart of modern architecture, I would of entitled it "try our bites" well done. Added to favorites.</td>', 'I find this fantastic and yes unfortunately this is the heart of modern architecture, I would of entitled it "try our bites" well done. Added to favorites.', '2012-01-18 06:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6648406, 992575, 8759, '<td valign="top">Like it overall. Dislike the overexposure in the middle. Maybe a spot metering if possible? 6</td>', 'Like it overall. Dislike the overexposure in the middle. Maybe a spot metering if possible? 6', '2012-01-18 07:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6648408, 992588, 8759, '<td valign="top">Hehe</td>', 'Hehe', '2012-01-18 07:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6648409, 992558, 8759, '<td valign="top">Love it!</td>', 'Love it!', '2012-01-18 07:46:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6648411, 992364, 8759, '<td valign="top">Could have achieved more in post processing. Nevertheless is still a very good try. 7</td>', 'Could have achieved more in post processing. Nevertheless is still a very good try. 7', '2012-01-18 07:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6648413, 992082, 8759, '<td valign="top">Impressive.</td>', 'Impressive.', '2012-01-18 07:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6648414, 992509, 8759, '<td valign="top">9</td>', '9', '2012-01-18 07:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6648511, 992448, 23098, '<td valign="top">A very interesting and emotive image. My favorite.</td>', 'A very interesting and emotive image. My favorite.', '2012-01-18 09:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6648512, 992509, 23098, '<td valign="top">This should be contender for a ribbon. Nice comp.</td>', 'This should be contender for a ribbon. Nice comp.', '2012-01-18 09:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6648513, 991917, 23098, '<td valign="top">Nicely captured.</td>', 'Nicely captured.', '2012-01-18 09:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6648568, 992195, 18197, '<td valign="top">You''re scaring me here. Go Long Shots!</td>', 'You''re scaring me here. Go Long Shots!', '2012-01-18 11:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6648570, 992364, 18197, '<td valign="top">I love the reflections you''ve captured here. Absolutely stunning!</td>', 'I love the reflections you''ve captured here. Absolutely stunning!', '2012-01-18 11:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6648574, 992448, 18197, '<td valign="top">Great image ... one that I really like ... The connection to architecture is somewhat tenuous but I''m looking past that. I like the arrangement of the jars and the lines created by the wiring. I find the notion of the speakers broadcasting into empty jars interesting and coupled with your title, a provocative image. The image is virtually perfect technically.<br/> <br/>Just returned for another look and wait, there''s more. I just noticed the butterflies. Now I''ve got to think about this some more.</td>', 'Great image ... one that I really like ... The connection to architecture is somewhat tenuous but I''m looking past that. I like the arrangement of the jars and the lines created by the wiring. I find the notion of the speakers broadcasting into empty jars interesting and coupled with your title, a provocative image. The image is virtually perfect technically. Just returned for another look and wait, there''s more. I just noticed the butterflies. Now I''ve got to think about this some more.', '2012-01-18 11:27:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6648575, 992456, 18197, '<td valign="top">I can imagine I''m 16, on probation, showing up for an encounter with justice. A very very emotional experience for me. Go Long Shots!</td>', 'I can imagine I''m 16, on probation, showing up for an encounter with justice. A very very emotional experience for me. Go Long Shots!', '2012-01-18 11:27:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6648581, 992477, 118154, '<td valign="top">Like the inside outside nice shot.</td>', 'Like the inside outside nice shot.', '2012-01-18 11:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6648584, 992449, 118154, '<td valign="top">Architecture is good but the back view of these things really spoil the shot for me.</td>', 'Architecture is good but the back view of these things really spoil the shot for me.', '2012-01-18 11:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6648586, 992587, 118154, '<td valign="top">Makes me tip my head to look at it,works well.</td>', 'Makes me tip my head to look at it,works well.', '2012-01-18 11:36:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6648588, 992457, 118154, '<td valign="top">Lovin'' the movement.</td>', 'Lovin'' the movement.', '2012-01-18 11:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6648653, 992365, 100831, '<td valign="top">Very interesting title - crazy perspective. Love the shadows</td>', 'Very interesting title - crazy perspective. Love the shadows', '2012-01-18 12:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6648741, 992195, 68020, '<td valign="top">Kitty Cat! Great shot Rian...Man it''s like it''s staring at me! Go Long Shots!!</td>', 'Kitty Cat! Great shot Rian...Man it''s like it''s staring at me! Go Long Shots!!', '2012-01-18 14:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6648743, 992199, 68020, '<td valign="top">No "Baghead" comment here Mita! I <b>really</b> love this shot! It reminds me of sailing but the angle also gives it an "M.C. Escher" effect with the people standing above, then the stairs, then the people below. This is an awesome capture...just great composistion and feel. I definitely see this on the front page! GO LONGSHOOTS!!!!</td>', 'No "Baghead" comment here Mita! I really love this shot! It reminds me of sailing but the angle also gives it an "M.C. Escher" effect with the people standing above, then the stairs, then the people below. This is an awesome capture...just great composistion and feel. I definitely see this on the front page! GO LONGSHOOTS!!!!', '2012-01-18 14:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6648746, 992456, 68020, '<td valign="top">George!...another shot I love! Maybe it''s my love for Philly, no.. it''s more than that, it has an amazing feel, it shows the power that this building respects. It''s a great capture and I really think this should do well! Go Long Shots!</td>', 'George!...another shot I love! Maybe it''s my love for Philly, no.. it''s more than that, it has an amazing feel, it shows the power that this building respects. It''s a great capture and I really think this should do well! Go Long Shots!', '2012-01-18 14:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6648778, 992448, 112739, '<td valign="top">What an interesting and thought provoking image.</td>', 'What an interesting and thought provoking image.', '2012-01-18 15:25:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6648978, 992147, 142816, '<td valign="top">I like your composition, having a foreground element in focus along with the beautiful columns in the back.  The person on the bike adds extra interest for me.  The colors are magnificent!  I sometimes have a hard time pinning down my emotions (think I have too many :), but I definitely feel uplifted/optimistic/uplifted by your photo.  Thanks!</td>', 'I like your composition, having a foreground element in focus along with the beautiful columns in the back.  The person on the bike adds extra interest for me.  The colors are magnificent!  I sometimes have a hard time pinning down my emotions (think I have too many :), but I definitely feel uplifted/optimistic/uplifted by your photo.  Thanks!', '2012-01-18 19:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6648985, 991925, 142816, '<td valign="top">Wow.  I didn''t think an emissions stack could be so pretty.  It almost looks like a sculpture.  The sky is fabulous.  You waited for this shot it seems to me.  Great light, right sky.  Technically nice with good focus and composition.  I used to do air quality emission work, so I know what can come out of stacks, but for me I see a beautifully framed (the sky) sculpture (the stack).  Perhaps if the stack was not so nice looking, I''d have a different emotional response.  Thanks!</td>', 'Wow.  I didn''t think an emissions stack could be so pretty.  It almost looks like a sculpture.  The sky is fabulous.  You waited for this shot it seems to me.  Great light, right sky.  Technically nice with good focus and composition.  I used to do air quality emission work, so I know what can come out of stacks, but for me I see a beautifully framed (the sky) sculpture (the stack).  Perhaps if the stack was not so nice looking, I''d have a different emotional response.  Thanks!', '2012-01-18 19:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6648988, 992509, 142816, '<td valign="top">Really interesting compositon and elements.  I am impressed with the good focus throughout the entire statue, and most of the building.  I''m new to photography, so I may not say this the right way, but if you had more selective focus, the image would not have the impact it does.  Hope this makes sense.  The title is perfect.  Very nice!</td>', 'Really interesting compositon and elements.  I am impressed with the good focus throughout the entire statue, and most of the building.  I''m new to photography, so I may not say this the right way, but if you had more selective focus, the image would not have the impact it does.  Hope this makes sense.  The title is perfect.  Very nice!', '2012-01-18 19:56:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649075, 992509, 11769, '<td valign="top">Majestic</td>', 'Majestic', '2012-01-18 21:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
