(6649572, 992540, 100831, '<td valign="top">this has a real charm to it. I like the dof, the view, and the quirky sort of haphazarness in how this fits together.</td>', 'this has a real charm to it. I like the dof, the view, and the quirky sort of haphazarness in how this fits together.', '2012-01-19 13:02:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649574, 992466, 100831, '<td valign="top">the title doesn''t do much for me but I like the picture.</td>', 'the title doesn''t do much for me but I like the picture.', '2012-01-19 13:02:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649581, 991910, 100831, '<td valign="top">I like the idea for the challenge and the shot itself is fine. What bothers me are the signigicant black borders.</td>', 'I like the idea for the challenge and the shot itself is fine. What bothers me are the signigicant black borders.', '2012-01-19 13:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649582, 992360, 100831, '<td valign="top">good</td>', 'good', '2012-01-19 13:04:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649585, 992558, 100831, '<td valign="top">oh my, this is daring and very terrific.</td>', 'oh my, this is daring and very terrific.', '2012-01-19 13:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649589, 992560, 100831, '<td valign="top">I love the tree.</td>', 'I love the tree.', '2012-01-19 13:06:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649591, 992502, 100831, '<td valign="top">If this were mine the contrasts would be in black and white but the funky colors work well and I know the voters will like this interpretation.</td>', 'If this were mine the contrasts would be in black and white but the funky colors work well and I know the voters will like this interpretation.', '2012-01-19 13:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649594, 992477, 100831, '<td valign="top">There''s lots of architecture in there... nice view.</td>', 'There''s lots of architecture in there... nice view.', '2012-01-19 13:09:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649595, 992570, 100831, '<td valign="top">Somebody knew what they were doing when they built that there.</td>', 'Somebody knew what they were doing when they built that there.', '2012-01-19 13:11:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649805, 992365, 113278, '<td valign="top">Fantastic. The pov, the light and shadows, the comp... everything works very well.</td>', 'Fantastic. The pov, the light and shadows, the comp... everything works very well.', '2012-01-19 19:09:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649807, 991476, 113278, '<td valign="top">Spooky, straight out of a horror movie, nice work.</td>', 'Spooky, straight out of a horror movie, nice work.', '2012-01-19 19:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649808, 992527, 113278, '<td valign="top">The light and shadows really makes this image.</td>', 'The light and shadows really makes this image.', '2012-01-19 19:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649809, 992466, 113278, '<td valign="top">excellent composition. Love it.</td>', 'excellent composition. Love it.', '2012-01-19 19:11:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649863, 992067, 49018, '<td valign="top">Heheheh, a different view, people emoted by the surrounding architecture. The more I look at it, the more I feel the impulse to laugh out loud. I secretely hope to find out she was talking about the refurbishment of the chapel, rather than the refurbishment of her soul.<br/> <br/>After looking at it for a while, I feel a tigher crop to exclude the left and top spotlights would have been quite effective. But I perhaps can guess why you went for a wider framing. 8 - No, bumped to 9</td>', 'Heheheh, a different view, people emoted by the surrounding architecture. The more I look at it, the more I feel the impulse to laugh out loud. I secretely hope to find out she was talking about the refurbishment of the chapel, rather than the refurbishment of her soul. After looking at it for a while, I feel a tigher crop to exclude the left and top spotlights would have been quite effective. But I perhaps can guess why you went for a wider framing. 8 - No, bumped to 9', '2012-01-19 20:31:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649871, 992587, 49018, '<td valign="top">Good job. A pretty armonious ascension and very graphical. My only quibble, and here I am being completely honest and an horrible nitpicker, is that, while I found the wave like vertical vertigo impressive and so moving, I don''t necessarily find it graceful. It could also be graceful, but that''s really not the main feeling, and this was actually my first impression when seeing the photograph. Then, composition, choice of light and cloudscape, DOF and BW all are competent and excellent. The idea of using the writing is brilliant.. Mmmm.. 9</td>', 'Good job. A pretty armonious ascension and very graphical. My only quibble, and here I am being completely honest and an horrible nitpicker, is that, while I found the wave like vertical vertigo impressive and so moving, I don''t necessarily find it graceful. It could also be graceful, but that''s really not the main feeling, and this was actually my first impression when seeing the photograph. Then, composition, choice of light and cloudscape, DOF and BW all are competent and excellent. The idea of using the writing is brilliant.. Mmmm.. 9', '2012-01-19 20:41:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649873, 991965, 49018, '<td valign="top">A frowning house :) Excellent use of perspective and extra kudos for doing this without relying on ominious lighting or BW processing. A nice sunny day and still a feel of not being welcome.. 8</td>', 'A frowning house :) Excellent use of perspective and extra kudos for doing this without relying on ominious lighting or BW processing. A nice sunny day and still a feel of not being welcome.. 8', '2012-01-19 20:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649876, 992364, 49018, '<td valign="top">Fitting idea and well executed. 8</td>', 'Fitting idea and well executed. 8', '2012-01-19 20:45:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649877, 992509, 49018, '<td valign="top">Excellent choice of perspective, infinite ascension and sucked in by the blue sky itself.<br/>I like how the image illustrates the effect of progressive desaturation due to the angle of incidence of light. 8</td>', 'Excellent choice of perspective, infinite ascension and sucked in by the blue sky itself.I like how the image illustrates the effect of progressive desaturation due to the angle of incidence of light. 8', '2012-01-19 20:49:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649879, 991917, 49018, '<td valign="top">I thought I would see this building again :)<br/>Wonderful, I very much like the folds and hdr, if that''s what it is, works really well here.</td>', 'I thought I would see this building again :)Wonderful, I very much like the folds and hdr, if that''s what it is, works really well here.', '2012-01-19 20:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649880, 992357, 49018, '<td valign="top">I like the concept and the choice of structure. Processing detracts a bit from this. I am not a fan of sharpness as a rule of life, but I feel more detail would have suited the image better, particularly for those not familiar with farm shows. 6</td>', 'I like the concept and the choice of structure. Processing detracts a bit from this. I am not a fan of sharpness as a rule of life, but I feel more detail would have suited the image better, particularly for those not familiar with farm shows. 6', '2012-01-19 20:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649891, 992551, 94265, '<td valign="top">At first glance I thought this was fairly impressive but on closer inspection, the image is terribly pixellated over the sky and near the bottom. I''m not sure what processing you did or what compression you saved at but the image has really suffered for it.</td>', 'At first glance I thought this was fairly impressive but on closer inspection, the image is terribly pixellated over the sky and near the bottom. I''m not sure what processing you did or what compression you saved at but the image has really suffered for it.', '2012-01-19 21:08:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649893, 992541, 49018, '<td valign="top">It took me one week to notice.. hemm.. but yes, I see what''s really moving and, as a dad, I am darn moved..9<br/>Ok, on second thought, you got me.<br/>Père Lachaise, grandeur and Jim Morrison, de rigueur Marx tomb and illustruous neighbours in Highgate, countless Mother Maries in countless non-descript countryside graveyards visited on a whim. <br/>Nothing of that obligatory routine ever moved me.<br/>But my eye always falls there, looks for them. Sometimes an angel, sculpted toys, sometimes only a plain slab of stone. Ebenezer Scrooge''s worst dream comes true, and there is no way back.<br/>10, just because it doesn''t go to 11.</td>', 'It took me one week to notice.. hemm.. but yes, I see what''s really moving and, as a dad, I am darn moved..9Ok, on second thought, you got me.Père Lachaise, grandeur and Jim Morrison, de rigueur Marx tomb and illustruous neighbours in Highgate, countless Mother Maries in countless non-descript countryside graveyards visited on a whim. Nothing of that obligatory routine ever moved me.But my eye always falls there, looks for them. Sometimes an angel, sculpted toys, sometimes only a plain slab of stone. Ebenezer Scrooge''s worst dream comes true, and there is no way back.10, just because it doesn''t go to 11.', '2012-01-19 21:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649894, 991771, 49018, '<td valign="top">It is certainly emotive to an extent. I would have liked a bit more contrast in the BW and, while I am not a fan of sharpening all over, I feel in this case more focus on the right branches would have helped. But that''s because I see a link between the plants and the tomb, so it''s just my interpretation. <br/>And perhaps I am missing something, not sure..<br/>7</td>', 'It is certainly emotive to an extent. I would have liked a bit more contrast in the BW and, while I am not a fan of sharpening all over, I feel in this case more focus on the right branches would have helped. But that''s because I see a link between the plants and the tomb, so it''s just my interpretation. And perhaps I am missing something, not sure..7', '2012-01-19 21:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649897, 992551, 49018, '<td valign="top">Certainly imposing and well framed for effect, and it certainly speaks authority to me. Perhaps it doesn''t move me over a certain point, perhaps slightly intimidates me.</td>', 'Certainly imposing and well framed for effect, and it certainly speaks authority to me. Perhaps it doesn''t move me over a certain point, perhaps slightly intimidates me.', '2012-01-19 21:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649900, 992199, 49018, '<td valign="top">Impressive architecture, great framing and use of the human figures to illustrate scale. Not necessarily moving though, or perhaps it would if seen printed large format. Very good, competent work,</td>', 'Impressive architecture, great framing and use of the human figures to illustrate scale. Not necessarily moving though, or perhaps it would if seen printed large format. Very good, competent work,', '2012-01-19 21:21:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649904, 992585, 49018, '<td valign="top">I love the real and implied geometries, and the black and white tratment. Contrast is excellent and well suiting, it reminds me of some Russian cinematography. The riddle, if there is one, is however lost on me..</td>', 'I love the real and implied geometries, and the black and white tratment. Contrast is excellent and well suiting, it reminds me of some Russian cinematography. The riddle, if there is one, is however lost on me..', '2012-01-19 21:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649912, 992543, 54645, '<td valign="top">Gripping</td>', 'Gripping', '2012-01-19 21:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649913, 992401, 49018, '<td valign="top">Impressive. Cambodia? I am a bit divided about this image. In order to find this moving, I need to think of myself walking surrounded by this amazing architecture and surroundings, in the silence, stopping by to examine the countless statues and details, to look at the looming trees and shade my face from the sun spearing them. To stop and reflect on how long silence came quietly living there, filling everything. The image evokes all of this with a certain effort on my part, and the help of countless documentaries and my very own memories. Perhaps not a defect of the image, but of the subject matter. Very good job in the B&amp;W processing and framing.</td>', 'Impressive. Cambodia? I am a bit divided about this image. In order to find this moving, I need to think of myself walking surrounded by this amazing architecture and surroundings, in the silence, stopping by to examine the countless statues and details, to look at the looming trees and shade my face from the sun spearing them. To stop and reflect on how long silence came quietly living there, filling everything. The image evokes all of this with a certain effort on my part, and the help of countless documentaries and my very own memories. Perhaps not a defect of the image, but of the subject matter. Very good job in the B&W processing and framing.', '2012-01-19 21:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649915, 992558, 54645, '<td valign="top">Lonely</td>', 'Lonely', '2012-01-19 21:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649916, 992156, 49018, '<td valign="top">I like your take, certainly original and very true. Possibly I would have liked to see a bit more blurry details of the pub, not because of the building/structure requirements in the challenge description, but because it would have helped the image speaking even without a title. Then, it''s all personal perception, and heavily dependent on the number of pints :)</td>', 'I like your take, certainly original and very true. Possibly I would have liked to see a bit more blurry details of the pub, not because of the building/structure requirements in the challenge description, but because it would have helped the image speaking even without a title. Then, it''s all personal perception, and heavily dependent on the number of pints :)', '2012-01-19 21:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649918, 992401, 54645, '<td valign="top">Richly detailed history.</td>', 'Richly detailed history.', '2012-01-19 21:36:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649921, 992038, 76335, '<td valign="top">Like a charcoal storm...</td>', 'Like a charcoal storm...', '2012-01-19 21:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649922, 991476, 54645, '<td valign="top">Nice effct</td>', 'Nice effct', '2012-01-19 21:40:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649925, 991965, 76335, '<td valign="top">A lesson in composition here. Perfect the way the twig echoes (mocks) the dilapidated antenna.</td>', 'A lesson in composition here. Perfect the way the twig echoes (mocks) the dilapidated antenna.', '2012-01-19 21:41:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649928, 991578, 76335, '<td valign="top">Powerfully subtle.</td>', 'Powerfully subtle.', '2012-01-19 21:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649929, 992356, 76335, '<td valign="top">Icy!</td>', 'Icy!', '2012-01-19 21:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649930, 992502, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nice twangy tones here -- like cross-processed film.</td>', 'Nice twangy tones here -- like cross-processed film.', '2012-01-19 21:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649931, 992457, 54645, '<td valign="top">Splendid, but a stretch.</td>', 'Splendid, but a stretch.', '2012-01-19 21:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649932, 992195, 54645, '<td valign="top">Transformer, great find.</td>', 'Transformer, great find.', '2012-01-19 21:43:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649933, 992502, 49018, '<td valign="top">Very good framing, and I mean it. The concept is always interesting, even though not too new. I''ll be honest. I don''t find it very moving. I would have, perhaps, if the reflected oldies were obviously ramshackled, kind of suggesting that the new is on it''s way to crush the old. Or if the reflected building were not imposing, if I could see and old past in the reflections, rather than something that comes from the past but is still here and, well mantained, will stay.<br/>Sorry if perhaps sounds like a criticism, is more like a well meant suggestion.<br/>Technically, very good job, I am just uncertain about the saturation, hue and loss of detail on the reflections, but it really is a matter of taste.</td>', 'Very good framing, and I mean it. The concept is always interesting, even though not too new. I''ll be honest. I don''t find it very moving. I would have, perhaps, if the reflected oldies were obviously ramshackled, kind of suggesting that the new is on it''s way to crush the old. Or if the reflected building were not imposing, if I could see and old past in the reflections, rather than something that comes from the past but is still here and, well mantained, will stay.Sorry if perhaps sounds like a criticism, is more like a well meant suggestion.Technically, very good job, I am just uncertain about the saturation, hue and loss of detail on the reflections, but it really is a matter of taste.', '2012-01-19 21:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649935, 991704, 49018, '<td valign="top">While this kind of look is frequently coupled with that kind of contrast on the sky, I personally would have found the picture more emotive (in the sense of evoking the awe of being there in person in a  sunny day) if the sky was far more natural looking. But that''s just me, I guess :)<br/>Good choice of structure.</td>', 'While this kind of look is frequently coupled with that kind of contrast on the sky, I personally would have found the picture more emotive (in the sense of evoking the awe of being there in person in a  sunny day) if the sky was far more natural looking. But that''s just me, I guess :)Good choice of structure.', '2012-01-19 21:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649938, 992477, 49018, '<td valign="top">Very good BW. Not sure if emotive, but it''s a good portrait of a certain England, I like it. 7</td>', 'Very good BW. Not sure if emotive, but it''s a good portrait of a certain England, I like it. 7', '2012-01-19 21:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649939, 991910, 49018, '<td valign="top">That kind of almost solidified sky is always a bit over the top for me, but here it works well in conveying the intended mood, as it does the contrasty PP.<br/>7</td>', 'That kind of almost solidified sky is always a bit over the top for me, but here it works well in conveying the intended mood, as it does the contrasty PP.7', '2012-01-19 21:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649941, 992475, 54645, '<td valign="top">Ha!</td>', 'Ha!', '2012-01-19 21:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649942, 991704, 94815, '<td valign="top">Good, crisp and nearly monochromatic metallics and glass against contrasty, cold-toned clouds makes a modernistic, cold impact.</td>', 'Good, crisp and nearly monochromatic metallics and glass against contrasty, cold-toned clouds makes a modernistic, cold impact.', '2012-01-19 21:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649943, 992548, 54645, '<td valign="top">Here, you are the architect; defiling the golden arches with dark movement, ironically slow. Well done.<br/> <br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=963227" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/54645/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_963227.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/54645/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_963227.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/54645/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_963227.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Here, you are the architect; defiling the golden arches with dark movement, ironically slow. Well done.  ', '2012-01-19 21:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649945, 992038, 54645, '<td valign="top">Excellent construction. Foreboding, yet there is a calming presence in the textured tones.<br/> <br/> <br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=963227" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/54645/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_963227.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/54645/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_963227.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/54645/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_963227.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Excellent construction. Foreboding, yet there is a calming presence in the textured tones.   ', '2012-01-19 21:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649946, 992389, 49018, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective, it might have been even more imposing with a tighter crop, if that was the intention. And that would have afforded for more of the interesting details of the structure to show off, the mark of the time is always quite moving. The lack of detail in the sky, along with saturation and what looks like a bit of CA in the branches, damage a bit the final result with this choise of framing. The surroundings are certainly interesting, but perhaps underexposure and/or a polarizer would have helped, in my opinion.</td>', 'Nice perspective, it might have been even more imposing with a tighter crop, if that was the intention. And that would have afforded for more of the interesting details of the structure to show off, the mark of the time is always quite moving. The lack of detail in the sky, along with saturation and what looks like a bit of CA in the branches, damage a bit the final result with this choise of framing. The surroundings are certainly interesting, but perhaps underexposure and/or a polarizer would have helped, in my opinion.', '2012-01-19 21:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649947, 992381, 49018, '<td valign="top">Interesting and illustrative. Perhaps not too moving, despite of the pleasant concept.</td>', 'Interesting and illustrative. Perhaps not too moving, despite of the pleasant concept.', '2012-01-19 21:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649948, 992566, 49018, '<td valign="top">A descent to heaven :) While I like the symmetry, I don''t find it terribly moving. I would if the photo was rotated 180 degrees though, but that''s just mer being weird I guess :D</td>', 'A descent to heaven :) While I like the symmetry, I don''t find it terribly moving. I would if the photo was rotated 180 degrees though, but that''s just mer being weird I guess :D', '2012-01-19 21:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649950, 992587, 94815, '<td valign="top">I think she''s got it. Spectacularly successful shot of the building I worked in for 9 years and shot many times, but this works best because it uses those churning clouds like the wake of a massive ship through a cosmic sea.</td>', 'I think she''s got it. Spectacularly successful shot of the building I worked in for 9 years and shot many times, but this works best because it uses those churning clouds like the wake of a massive ship through a cosmic sea.', '2012-01-19 21:58:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649951, 992575, 54645, '<td valign="top">Open, airy, a place of peaceful healing. Ahead of it''s time, now waiting. You have captured this well, although tone mapping, etc, robbed your ability to use rich shadows and contrast to further convey the mood. Overall I like it. 8</td>', 'Open, airy, a place of peaceful healing. Ahead of it''s time, now waiting. You have captured this well, although tone mapping, etc, robbed your ability to use rich shadows and contrast to further convey the mood. Overall I like it. 8', '2012-01-19 21:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649952, 992082, 49018, '<td valign="top">Good use of symmetry and the human figure to illustrate the scale. If I think to the concept described by the title, I feel that a much closer view of the person, perhaps while gazing around at the imposing ceiling, could have conveyed the concept better. Good image.</td>', 'Good use of symmetry and the human figure to illustrate the scale. If I think to the concept described by the title, I feel that a much closer view of the person, perhaps while gazing around at the imposing ceiling, could have conveyed the concept better. Good image.', '2012-01-19 22:00:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6649953, 991578, 54645, '<td valign="top">Soft, subtle, mood.</td>', 'Soft, subtle, mood.', '2012-01-19 22:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
