(6650086, 992586, 92953, '<td valign="top"><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=142483" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">hmbutler</a>Thanks so much for the comments and vote, <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=142483" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">hmbutler</a> Yes. it''s raining with strong wind. I love the shot because rain add some emotive feeling to the building but I''m no expierience how to get the best shot of rain and how to PP it. Maybe someday I should be able to do it better. <br/> <br/> <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=117534" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">littlemav</a> Thanks, Katie. It''s tough shot and I''m still learning. By the way, I''m Alex. Cheers!!!</td>', ' hmbutlerThanks so much for the comments and vote,  hmbutler Yes. it''s raining with strong wind. I love the shot because rain add some emotive feeling to the building but I''m no expierience how to get the best shot of rain and how to PP it. Maybe someday I should be able to do it better.    littlemav Thanks, Katie. It''s tough shot and I''m still learning. By the way, I''m Alex. Cheers!!!', '2012-01-20 00:19:44.000000', NULL, 0),
