(6654955, 992448, 59029, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club!<br/> <br/>First impression: Pity more of the voters didn''t ''get'' this shot and went with the usual literal interpretation of the challenge. I gave you a 7.<br/> <br/>Artistic: Very strong conceptual image but hardly stale.  This is a breath of fresh air. <br/> <br/>Technical: Lighting is crisp and set is spotlessly clean, and the eye can''t help but wander from one jar to the next by the wires.  I had no ideas that those were speakers!<br/> <br/>Overall: Please please please enter more wildly out-of-the-box images like this, this is exactly the kind of thing DPC in general needs to see more of.  And don''t worry about the scores; they just prove especially in this case that the voters have eyes of cloth.   No point trying to please the capricious DPC voters, so shoot and enter what is true to you and your vision.<br/> <br/>Feel free to PM me,<br/> <br/>Susan</td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club! First impression: Pity more of the voters didn''t ''get'' this shot and went with the usual literal interpretation of the challenge. I gave you a 7. Artistic: Very strong conceptual image but hardly stale.  This is a breath of fresh air.  Technical: Lighting is crisp and set is spotlessly clean, and the eye can''t help but wander from one jar to the next by the wires.  I had no ideas that those were speakers! Overall: Please please please enter more wildly out-of-the-box images like this, this is exactly the kind of thing DPC in general needs to see more of.  And don''t worry about the scores; they just prove especially in this case that the voters have eyes of cloth.   No point trying to please the capricious DPC voters, so shoot and enter what is true to you and your vision. Feel free to PM me, Susan', '2012-01-25 16:17:21.000000', NULL, 0),
